Package: hvtiR
Type: Package
Title: Install and Check the HVTI R Package Family
Version: 1.3.7
Date: 2026-11-06
Authors@R: person("John", "Ehrlinger", email = "john.ehrlinger@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Installs, updates and reports, in a single step, on the family
    of R packages from the Cardiovascular Outcomes, Registries and Research
    (CORR) group of the Heart, Vascular and Thoracic Institute (HVTI) at
    Cleveland Clinic.
    Members are resolved from public GitHub repositories with 'pak', keeping
    installations aligned with the source where family releases land first.
    Provides a status table comparing installed versions and source commits
    against the main branch on GitHub, and a diagnostic report for environment problems.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
